17:- **G2 (T06 accumulation claim without an accumulated-bowl frame in its Evidence line) — CLOSED.** The first firing found T06's core recurring claim — the molcajete's contents visibly accumulate across every episode boundary (green flesh → + white dice → + red cubes → + green houses) — bound only by a first-deposit frame and the shell, with no accumulated bowl state cited in T06's own line. T06's Evidence line now cites ev/t089-accumulated-bowl.jpg (the accumulated bowl state at serving — the mashed mixture still showing its dice, cubes, and houses), which shows the accumulated end-state the claim predicts, alongside ev/t018-scoop-molcajete.jpg (the deposit in progress) and ev/t015-pit-reveal.jpg (the shell worked from). The accumulation claim is now bound in T06's own evidence, in the form the claim takes. No residue.
23:- **Internal structural completeness — 1.0.** All eight §3.3 sections present and substantive in both forms (mechanical census confirmed): §1 specimen identity + technical facts (title/creator/platform/URL, upload 2013-03-07, probe 100.894 s / 1920×1080 @ 24 fps, displayed counts copied-not-interpreted from post.json, speech record priced from a full-track ASR/VAD census — 0 speech segments); §2 consumer (see below); §3 catalogue T01–T16, each with name · timestamps · mechanics · why it works · evidence; §4 tempo map by ingredient episode (S1–S8 spans, beats, beats/s, character) with its counting basis stated and its threshold sensitivity printed; §5 goods and bads (see below); §6 lessons L1–L12, each tagged with class, container, implied change, and cost — lesson-class census 6/6: technique · trick · texture · storytelling pattern · pacing principle all tagged present, and transcript device priced ABSENT with its ground stated in L12 (no narration, no captions, 0-segment VAD census; the ordering device filed under storytelling L7) — Amendment A4 clause 1 satisfied on the face, no silent class absence; §7 idea bank, seven items each standing on a named technique; §8 reception link in the charged form ("not yet run — charged to reception-analysis," raw counts filed uninterpreted in §1). The first firing withheld 0.05 from this dimension solely for the G1/G2 citation gaps; both are closed, so the dimension stands complete.
25:- **Evidence binding — 0.95.** Every catalogue entry binds named ev frames, and sequence/timing claims bind clips where the claim takes that form (T04, T09, T10, T11, T13, T15, T16 clip-bound; 7 clips, every motion-claim entry clip-ruled per the firing census; 29 ev frames on disk / 29 cited) — evidence binds in the form the claim takes (A4 clause 3). The two first-firing defects in this dimension are cured (G1, G2 — closure above), and the label corrections (t064 → the filament it shows; T16 dip → ~92 s with ev/t092-chip-dip.jpg) tighten label-to-claim fit further. The speech-absence claim binds to the ASR/VAD census, not to impression. Unresolved items print as unresolved rather than borrowing certainty: true shot count UNVERIFIED (31 @0.35 / 83 @0.20 printed as candidate counts only), T04's edit type not claimed, and §4's Observe hypothesis of preparation-wide acceleration expressly WITHDRAWN on the episode lengths, with the surviving local-acceleration claim re-scoped to named episodes. Withheld from 1.0 only because citation completeness on paper cannot certify frame-to-beat correspondence (the separate inspection gate's province, expressly outside this call) and T14's seasoning product is, by the packet's own honest pricing in B2, a gesture-only claim no frame could bind — a specimen limit the packet discloses, not a packet defect.
31:No taxonomy class applies to the packet as it now stands. By §4 precedence, checked in order: no MISSING-SECTION (all eight §3.3 sections present and substantive in both forms); no NO-CONSUMER (§2 satisfies the strengthened usable-recipient + intended-use form); no UNBOUND-EVIDENCE (the first firing's two instances, G1 and G2, are CLOSED as priced above, and no other unbound claim was found — every remaining uncertainty is printed as unverified or withdrawn rather than asserted); OMITTED-SOURCE-TECHNIQUE is not classifiable — no independent source inventory was fed; no VAGUE-MECHANIC primary (mechanics score 0.95, residue nonblocking); no RECEPTION-ABSENT (§8 present in the charged form, raw counts filed uninterpreted in §1).
35:None. G1 and G2 from the first firing are closed; no new gap was found in this re-firing.
31:- **TECHNIQUES entries** — one per catalogue technique (16), each: name · one-line mechanics (from packet §3, limits carried) · Tier line · Feeds line (packet → timestamps → exact ev/ frame filenames, verified on disk at Verify
32:- **Obligation marks (Amendment A3, two-leg rule — a motion technique recreatable as HTML in a production container = OWED):** OWED — T227 substitution-at-action halving reveal **#102** (the packet's primary transition mechanism; swa
78:- **E3 Family files — DONE.** 16 new canonical entries T224–T239 (openings 2 · transitions 9 · diagrams 3 · endings 2) + pointer lines (T224/T229 in endings · T232/T237 in word-animation · T229 in openings). Tier/Recreation upda
13:**Secondary consumer: Hadosh Academy explainer production — diagram and word-animation surfaces**, for object-metaphor substitution: an object cast in one role is re-read by the verb performed on it (casting vs literalization, §3 T07/T09), the mechanism an explainer needs when a diagram object must change meaning mid-argument without a cutaway.
54:### T07 — Casting by disassembly: the baseball onion
57:- **Why it works:** where T03 casts by appearance, T07 casts by structure: the object earns its role because the procedure can actually be performed on it.
60:### T08 — Slice integrity: cuts that hold together
68:- **Mechanics:** The slices are gathered and — at the moment the knife begins to dice them — they are a small stack of white dice. Successive chops multiply the dice: each pass lands more, smaller dice, until the board carries a pile of tiny dice, which the hands gather like chopped onion. Two mechanisms are coded separately (P-A4): the initial CASTING (baseball as onion, T07–T08) and the LITERALIZATION — the verb "to dice" made visible as its homonym. The multiplication is an intra-shot change: visible object-state changes with no shot boundary claimed.
140:- **B4 (24–29 s):** The slicing beat (T08) is the longest stretch with no transformation (≈5 s); priced as restraint in §3, it is also where the film's pulse sags before the dice payoff.
164:- A vocabulary short where each word is cast as a household object and re-read by the verb performed on it (stands on T03 + T07).

codex
**CONFIRMED-WITH-GAPS** — T232’s source record is sufficient for Recreation Cycle 039, Wave 36 §1 Observe. The packet and register agree on the core action and evidence. The end of the action needs firsthand timing, and the queue citation needs correction.

**Findings**

1. **Mechanics agree.** The baseball slices become white dice as chopping begins. Later chops yield more, smaller dice, which the hands gather. Both records describe the multiplication as an intra-shot change and claim no shot boundary. The packet separately assigns the baseball-as-onion setup to T07–T08. The two gaps closed at Packet #13 adoption concerned T01 and T06. [digest.md §T09](../../../../study/video-digests/2026-11-17-yt-dnjdjiwcfy/digest.md#L66) · [techniques-transitions.md §T232](../../../../study/style-library/techniques-transitions.md#L321) · [Cycle 020 adoption return](../../../../study-jobs/video-digestion/runs/2026-11-17-cycle-020-pes-fresh-guacamole/jev-packet-return-2.md#L14)
2. **Gap — the final evidence frame falls outside both windows.** The digest and register both give the technique as 29–36 s and cite `t038-dice-sprinkle.jpg`. The digest identifies that frame as the later deposit into the molcajete and gives the clip as 28–36 s. I probed the archive at 100.894 s and the clip at 8.000 s, consistent with `36 − 28 = 8` s and a nominal technique span of `36 − 29 = 7` s. Sampled archive frames show the dice multiplying and the hands gathering them after the nominal endpoint. Observe should frame-step the archive around 36–38 s, record the gather and sprinkle boundaries, and specify which action the cut must contain before binding the segment under command 5. [digest.md §T09](../../../../study/video-digests/2026-11-17-yt-dnjdjiwcfy/digest.md#L66) · [techniques-transitions.md §T232](../../../../study/style-library/techniques-transitions.md#L321) · [guards.md command 5](../../../../study-jobs/recreation/guards/guards.md#L16)
3. **Gap — queue citation.** The supplied record cites a standalone `QUEUE.md` row #103. On disk the table ends at #99. The Wave 35 update names T232 in the #100–#105 backlog, and the register and Wave 36 census explicitly bind T232 to #103. The first-attempt disposition is supported by those entries. [QUEUE.md table end](../../../../study-jobs/QUEUE.md#L202) · [Wave 35 update](../../../../study-jobs/QUEUE.md#L206) · [TECHNIQUES.md tier register](../../../../study/style-library/TECHNIQUES.md#L152) · [Wave 36 RUN.md §0b](RUN.md#L11)
4. **Prior filings support first-attempt status.** The current T232 and T227 directories contain census material and no `scores.md` or filed scoring returns. I found no T236 artifact directory and no matching verdict-history entries in recreation or practice for the three IDs. T227 is the same-wave related technique, and T236 is the non-owed sibling explicitly tied to T232’s literalization mechanism. Scored attempts found across those IDs: **0**. Lens count and score arithmetic are inapplicable. [T232 artifact directory](../../../../study/recreations/T232-verb-literalization-dicing-dice/) · [T227 and T236 register entries](../../../../study/style-library/techniques-transitions.md#L306) · [recreation verdict history](../../../../study-jobs/recreation/verdict-history.md) · [practice verdict history](../../../../study-jobs/practice/verdict-history.md)

**Limits** — I checked archived metadata and sampled frames. Exact action boundaries and production edit continuity remain unverified. The current filesystem establishes filing presence for this audit. The feeder’s claim about directory absence before the cycle remains unverified.

Body-write: none (read-only run)
